{"meta":{"id":"b1012652-82ef-46e0-985f-f73d17bce032","publication_id":"30c7e4c1-15ed-46d8-a23d-32c90e011794","web_title":"¿Qué es DeFi?","parameterized_web_title":"que-es-defi","utm_params_enabled":true,"utm_campaign":"que-es-defi","utm_medium":"referral","utm_source":"blog.telluscoop.com","web_subtitle":"En los últimos años, ha surgido un nuevo concepto dentro del ecosistema blockchain: DeFi, abreviatura de Finanzas Descentralizadas (Decentralized Finance en inglés). Este término engloba una serie de aplicaciones y servicios financieros construidos sobre redes blockchain, sin necesidad de intermediarios como bancos o entidades tradicionales.","web_audiences":"free","status":"published","active":true,"featured":false,"override_scheduled_at":"2025-04-29T13:00:00.000Z","slug":"queesdefi","is_premium":false,"image_url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/asset/file/38305a71-1ceb-41e2-a5e8-fb241a6d5f76/Versi%C3%B3n_Negra_Directorio__1_.png?t=1745432850","image_width":1292,"image_height":678,"meta_default_title":"¿Qué es DeFi?","meta_default_description":"Descubre el mundo de DeFi: finanzas descentralizadas que transforman los servicios financieros tradicionales usando blockchain, contratos inteligentes y eliminando intermediarios. 🌐💡","meta_og_title":"¿Qué es DeFi?","meta_og_description":"Descubre el mundo de DeFi: finanzas descentralizadas que transforman los servicios financieros tradicionales usando blockchain, contratos inteligentes y eliminando intermediarios. 🌐💡","meta_twitter_title":"¿Qué es DeFi?","meta_twitter_description":"En los últimos años, ha surgido un nuevo concepto dentro del ecosistema blockchain: DeFi, abreviatura de Finanzas Descentralizadas (Decentralized Finance en inglés). Este término engloba una serie de aplicaciones y servicios financieros construidos sobre redes blockchain, sin necesidad de intermediarios como bancos o entidades tradicionales.","audience":"free","comments_enabled":true,"comments_state":"default","enforce_gated_content":true,"enable_popup_on_scroll":false,"email_capture_title":"Suscríbete para seguir leyendo","email_capture_message":"Este contenido es gratuito, pero debes estar suscrito a Tellus Cooperative para continuar leyendo.","email_capture_cta":"Suscríbete","estimated_reading_time":3,"estimated_reading_time_display":"3 minutos","paywall_id":null,"authors":[{"id":"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12","name":"Pau Koh","profile_picture":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/pau_headshot_1.png","thumb":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/thumb_pau_headshot_1.png"},"landscape":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/landscape_pau_headshot_1.png"}},"bio":"𝘊𝘔𝘎𝘙/𝘛𝘦𝘭𝘭𝘶𝘴 𝘊𝘰𝘰𝘱𝘦𝘳𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘷𝘦","twitter_handle":"kl0ren","facebook_url":null,"instagram_url":null,"linkedin_url":null,"tiktok_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"discord_url":null,"bluesky_url":null}],"content_tags":[],"created_at":"2025-04-23T18:22:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T13:00:53Z","html":null,"hide_premium_post":false,"contains_subscriber_break":false,"is_accessible_for_free":true,"paywall_shown":false,"metered_usage_shown":false,"metered_viewed_count":null,"force_premium":false,"enforce_paywall_breaks":true,"display_thumbnail_on_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/pau-koh"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"definicin-general\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Definición general</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>DeFi</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> es un conjunto de herramientas y aplicaciones financieras que funcionan sobre una blockchain pública, utilizando contratos inteligentes para ejecutar operaciones como préstamos, intercambios, inversiones y pagos, sin necesidad de intermediarios centralizados.</span></p></div><div id=\"comparativa-finanzas-tradicionales-\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Comparativa: Finanzas tradicionales vs. Finanzas descentralizadas</span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-imageBlock _2fealp0\" style=\"--caption-alignment:center\"><div class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/05f9c6fc-c2ca-4ba9-9ba9-d4036e6ed94c/_27DEF6F3-7AB1-4BC0-B17D-E42AFDE99C65_.png?t=1745432655 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/05f9c6fc-c2ca-4ba9-9ba9-d4036e6ed94c/_27DEF6F3-7AB1-4BC0-B17D-E42AFDE99C65_.png?t=1745432655 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/05f9c6fc-c2ca-4ba9-9ba9-d4036e6ed94c/_27DEF6F3-7AB1-4BC0-B17D-E42AFDE99C65_.png?t=1745432655 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=430,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/05f9c6fc-c2ca-4ba9-9ba9-d4036e6ed94c/_27DEF6F3-7AB1-4BC0-B17D-E42AFDE99C65_.png?t=1745432655 1x\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/05f9c6fc-c2ca-4ba9-9ba9-d4036e6ed94c/_27DEF6F3-7AB1-4BC0-B17D-E42AFDE99C65_.png?t=1745432655\" alt=\"\" width=\"662\" height=\"186\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:0px;aspect-ratio:662 / 186;height:auto\" class=\"_2fealp2 _2fealp5\"></picture></div></div><div id=\"cmo-funciona-de-fi\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Cómo funciona DeFi?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Las plataformas DeFi se construyen principalmente sobre blockchains como </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Ethereum</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, aunque también existen proyectos en otras redes como Stellar, Solana o Avalanche.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El funcionamiento se basa en </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>contratos inteligentes</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, que son programas que se ejecutan automáticamente cuando se cumplen ciertas condiciones.</span></p></div><div id=\"ejemplos-de-servicios-de-fi\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ejemplos de servicios DeFi:</span></h3></div><div class=\"vl18bi0\"><ol class=\"vl18bi1\" translations=\"[object Object]\" start=\"1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Préstamos y créditos</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Usuarios pueden prestar y tomar prestado activos digitales sin intermediarios.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ejemplo: Aave, Compound.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Intercambios descentralizados (DEX)</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Permiten comprar o vender criptomonedas sin una casa de cambio centralizada.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ejemplo: Uniswap, Curve.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stablecoins descentralizadas</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Monedas estables sin respaldo bancario, como DAI, que buscan mantener paridad con el dólar.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ejemplo: MakerDAO.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Rendimientos y staking</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Inversiones que ofrecen retorno por proveer liquidez o participar en la validación de la red.</span></p></div></li></ol></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"ventajas-de-de-fi\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ventajas de DeFi</span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Acceso global</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Cualquier persona con conexión a internet puede participar.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Inclusión financiera</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: No requiere historial crediticio ni documentación bancaria.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Interoperabilidad</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Muchas aplicaciones DeFi se pueden combinar entre sí (“composability”).</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Transparencia y código abierto</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Las reglas del sistema están disponibles públicamente.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"riesgos-y-desafos\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Riesgos y desafíos</span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-imageBlock _2fealp0\" style=\"--caption-alignment:center\"><div class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e2a5d034-41a4-4189-9806-522379993d35/_CE96F4F6-DC60-48E9-AF6A-3B6286D28866_.png?t=1745432723 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e2a5d034-41a4-4189-9806-522379993d35/_CE96F4F6-DC60-48E9-AF6A-3B6286D28866_.png?t=1745432723 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e2a5d034-41a4-4189-9806-522379993d35/_CE96F4F6-DC60-48E9-AF6A-3B6286D28866_.png?t=1745432723 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=430,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e2a5d034-41a4-4189-9806-522379993d35/_CE96F4F6-DC60-48E9-AF6A-3B6286D28866_.png?t=1745432723 1x\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e2a5d034-41a4-4189-9806-522379993d35/_CE96F4F6-DC60-48E9-AF6A-3B6286D28866_.png?t=1745432723\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"654\" height=\"186\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:0px;aspect-ratio:654 / 186;height:auto\" class=\"_2fealp2 _2fealp5\"></picture></div></div><div id=\"qu-papel-juega-stellar-en-de-fi\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Qué papel juega Stellar en DeFi?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Aunque Ethereum ha sido la red principal para DeFi, otras blockchains como </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> están desarrollando soluciones enfocadas en pagos y transferencias con monedas estables y digitales. Stellar permite la emisión de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>activos tokenizados</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> y su intercambio rápido y económico.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Por ejemplo, plataformas como </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://stellarx.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" style=\"--wt-inline-link-underline-color-override:#ffffff;--wt-inline-link-color-override:#ffffff\"><span style=\"color:#030712;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\">StellarX</span></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#030712;font-family:inherit;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:16px\"> </span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">permiten realizar intercambios descentralizados utilizando activos emitidos en la red Stellar, con comisiones muy bajas y alta velocidad.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/2SHteza5dJ\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"-